  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat until shimmering.",
    "Add the turkey, breaking it apart with a spatula, and cook until browned, 4 to 6 minutes.",
    "Stir in the garlic and oregano and cook until fragrant, 1 to 2 minutes.",
    "Stir in the quinoa, broth, zucchini, tomatoes, and salt, then bring to a rolling boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low, cover, and simmer until the liquid is absorbed and the quinoa is tender, 12 to 15 minutes.",
    "Remove the skillet from the heat, then fold in the spinach, lemon zest, and lemon juice.",
    "Cover the skillet and let stand off the heat until the spinach wilts before serving."
